{"id":"steam-2928640","steam":2928640,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Countryball: World 1930","summary":"Lead your countryball to glory in a WWII-inspired turn-based grand strategy game. Build your nation, manage resources, recruit armies and generals, forge alliances, and conquer territory across multiple historical campaigns.","about":"Countryball: World 1930 is a turn-based grand strategy game about leading a country through uncertain history. Manage territory and resources, move armies, negotiate with rivals, and decide when diplomacy should give way to war—all with the expressive countryball cast at the center.\r\n\r\n\nTURN-BASED GRAND STRATEGY\n\r\n\r\nPlan one move at a time, then live with the consequences. Expand carefully, defend key borders, and adapt when alliances or fronts shift.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nBUILD AND MANAGE YOUR NATION\n\r\n\r\nDevelop territories, balance resources, and strengthen production so your campaigns can last longer than the first battle.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nDIPLOMACY, FACTIONS, AND WAR\n\r\n\r\nNegotiate treaties, form alliances, join factions, or challenge the powers around you. Recruit infantry, tanks, and aircraft, then commit them where they matter.\r\n\r\n\nGENERALS, SOLDIERS, AND EQUIPMENT\n\r\n\r\nHire generals, train specialized soldiers, and equip useful items as your countryball grows through the campaign.\r\n\r\n\nCREATE YOUR OWN COUNTRYBALL\n\r\n\r\nDraw a custom flag and bring your own countryball into the world.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nCAMPAIGNS ACROSS DIFFERENT ERAS\n\r\n\r\nPlay several history-inspired scenarios, each with a different balance of borders, rivals, and strategic problems.\r\n\r\n\nTRAINING AND SIDE ACTIVITIES\n\r\n\r\nUse minigames and side activities to train your countryball between larger decisions.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928640/047eedd8cca046b3c8cd94a5b51e115fb74fcb92/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794661697","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.